UPDATE companies SET description='Industrial Finishes, founded in 1958, operates a branch in Reno, Nevada The Reno location originated from the acquisition of Barrett Paints and Re-Neva Paint, which Industrial Finishes purchased and refreshed in 2012 to include one of the area''s few educational centers for finishing training.

