UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Pawtucket, Rhode Island, Interpak is a third-generation family-owned packaging manufacturer with a 70-year legacy. The company operates as the parent of a sister-brand ecosystem that includes Mason Box, Presentation Box + Display, and Jewelrypackaging.com, providing a single source for custom, stock, and quick-ship packaging.

Interpak produces custom luxury presentation packaging — hinged boxes, paperboard boxes, pouches, shopping bags, mailing and storage boxes, stock custom branded boxes, and wooden boxes — using precision hot-stamping, debossing, and multi-color printing. It offers both domestic and global manufacturing, flexible production runs, and a VIP Small Quantity Order program that accepts orders as low as 100 U.S.-made boxes. Lean manufacturing and a concept-to-completion approach integrate structural design, material selection, finishing, production, and program support, while the Flex Ship™ just-in-time inventory system helps customers manage replenishment.

The company serves jewelry, watch, award, premium gift, medical, industrial, e-commerce, retail, chocolate, stationery, coin, and giftware markets. Customers range from fine-jewelry brands needing keepsake-worthy unboxing to medical-device manufacturers requiring industrial boxes, and retailers seeking quick-ship stock boxes with custom stamping.

Interpak differentiates itself through American-made craftsmanship, FSC-certified sustainable materials, a 98% on-time delivery record, and a hub model that reduces vendor gaps by housing custom engineering, fast-turn replenishment, and repair-shipping solutions under one ownership. The business was built on the principle that packaging should be engineered like a product, not treated as decoration.', certifications=ARRAY['FSC Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Precision hot-stamping", "Debossing", "Multi-color printing", "Domestic manufacturing", "Global manufacturing", "Lean manufacturing", "Concept-to-completion (design, sampling, material selection, finishing, production, program support)", "JIT inventory management (Flex Ship)", "Small quantity orders (100 units)", "Free samples", "Custom packaging design", "Structural design", "Material selection", "Finishing", "Production", "Program support", "Stock and quick-ship solutions", "Custom stamping", "Patented wire closures (Mason Box)", "Sustainable packaging design", "Eco-friendly materials (recycled, reusable)", "Quality process control", "On-time delivery management", "Brand program management"], "industries": ["Jewelry", "Watches", "Awards", "Premium gifts", "Medical", "Industrial", "E-commerce", "Retail", "Chocolate", "Stationery", "Coins", "Giftware", "Class rings"], "materials": ["Paperboard", "Wood", "Recycled materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Domestic manufacturing with American-made craftsmanship", "Flex Ship\u2122 just-in-time inventory management", "VIP Small Quantity Order program (minimum 100 U.S.-made boxes)", "FSC-certified sustainable materials", "Sister-brand ecosystem (Mason Box, Presentation Box + Display, Jewelrypackaging.com) for single-source packaging"], "facts_used": ["Location: Pawtucket, Rhode Island -> db, /about", "Third-generation family-owned, 70-year legacy -> /about", "Sister brands: Mason Box, Presentation Bo