UPDATE companies SET description='Iron Work Studio is based in Owings, Maryland, and was founded in 1997 by Rob Link, a third-generation welder with a technical degree in electronic engineering and a background in the steamfitters’ union. Link began with a 200-square-foot warehouse in Severn, Maryland, before relocating the shop to Owings, where it has operated for over two decades.

The company fabricates custom iron products for residential settings, ranging from intricate fine-art pieces such as chandeliers, tables, and railings to large-scale custom installations. The four-person team handles welding, fabrication, CNC plasma cutting, and design work using AutoCAD, operating from a facility that has grown since its initial 200-square-foot space.

Examples from the company’s portfolio include chandeliers, tables, railings, and complex artistic building and design projects.

